{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44507","headline":"诗三百三首 二百四 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 二百四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世人何事可吁嗟，苦乐交煎勿底涯。\n生死往来多少劫，东西南北是谁家。\n张王李赵权时姓，六道三途事似麻。\n只爲主人不了绝，遂招迁谢逐迷邪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44507.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44507","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}